{"product_id":"buture-cordless-vacuum-cleaner-vc50-red","title":"Buture VC50 Red Cordless Vacuum Cleaner | 450W 33KPA","description":"\u003cp\u003eHave you ever wondered just how much dirt you're missing if you only use a regular broom instead of a powerful vacuum cleaner? With a vacuum cleaner, you can clean both visible dirt and the tiny particles you can’t see. A portable vacuum cleaner, like the Buture VC50 Red, offers the flexibility and ease to move around your home without lugging around a heavy machine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePowerful and Efficient Cleaning\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50 Portable Vacuum Cleaner stands out as a top choice for portable vacuum cleaners. Its powerful 450W motor, delivering 33Kpa suction power, handles dirt, dust, and debris effortlessly across carpets, hardwood floors, and upholstery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdaptive Cleaning Performance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith automatic adjustment, the VC50 seamlessly transitions between different surfaces, optimizing suction power for a thorough clean. The 55-minute runtime ensures you can clean large areas without interruption, and its lightweight 5.82 lbs design makes it easy to maneuver, whether you're tackling stairs, high shelves, or tight spaces.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEfficient and Convenient Usage\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50’s 0.3-gallon dust bin means fewer trips to empty, and a quick 4-5 hour recharge time ensures it’s always ready for your next cleaning session. The touch screen interface is intuitive, allowing easy mode switching and status monitoring. Included attachments like the crevice tool for tight spaces, a two-in-one brush for versatile cleaning, and a hair cleaning tool for pet hair make it adaptable for any cleaning task.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eReliable Power and Enhanced Air Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe VC50’s reliable battery pack provides consistent power, and dual HEPA and sponge filters capture fine dust and allergens, promoting cleaner air in your home. Although it doesn't stand on its own, the compact design makes it easy to store. Plus, it’s compatible with aroma tablets, adding a pleasant fragrance to your cleaning routine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure VC50 Red Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable class=\"vc50-table\" style=\"width: 99.9288%; height: 274.491px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eSpecification\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eSuction Power\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e450W\/33Kpa\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eAutomatic Adjustment\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eYes\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eRuntime\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e55mins\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eWeight\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e5.82 lbs\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eDust Bin Capacity\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e0.3 gal\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eCharging Time\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e4-5 Hours\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eTouch Screen\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eCrevice Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eTwo-in-one Brush\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eHair Cleaning Tool\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e✓\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eBattery Pack\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003ex1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eHEPA Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 19.6065px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003eSponge Filter\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 46.9026%; height: 19.6065px;\"\u003ex2\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45499212562687,"sku":"VC50R","price":145.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/fi